title: "The Canine Rosetta Stone: How Far Are We from Translating What Dogs Say? A Survey"
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "The dog2text Project"
year: 2026
date-released: "2026-11-10"
url: "https://github.com/mcxiaoxiao/dog2text"
repository-code: "https://github.com/mcxiaoxiao/dog2text"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - animal communication
